OL,3,GNEWSAFormer nightclub could become
OL,4,Achurch centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former nightclub could be transformed
OL,7,Finto a church.
OL,9,FThe State Club on Church Street in
OL,10,FGainsborough closed in 2010, after
OL,11,Fpreviously operating as a cinema and
OL,12,Ftoy shop.
OL,14,FAlive Church said it wanted to use the
OL,15,F1940s building "as a space for the
OL,16,Flocal community".
OL,18,FThe plans have been submitted to West
OL,19,FLindsey District Council and are open
OL,20,Fto public comment.
